Question 24: Given A = [[1,2],[3,4]] and B = [[5,6],[7,8]], print the element-wise product, the matrix product with np.matmul ([[19 22] [43 50]]), and the determinant of A with np.linalg.det (-2.0).

AIM: Finding element-wise product, matrix multiplication product and determinant of matrix(array)

Code:
import numpy as np
A=[[1,2],[3,4]]
B=[[5,6],[7,8]]
print("\nElement-wise product:\n", np.multiply(A,B))
print("\nMatrix Multiplication:\n", np.matmul(A,B))
print("\nDeterminant of A:",np.linalg.det(A))

